<title>USA: Learning Tree sets 50 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Learning Tree sets 50 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Learning Tree International Inc said Monday it has set a 50 percent stock dividend on its common stock.</p>
<p>The stock dividend will be paid on December 16 to stockholders of record as of December 6.</p>
<p>Learning Tree International has about 14,663,000 shares of common stock outstanding. After the stock dividend it will have about 21,994,500 shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
